    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n62106" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">λᾰχαίνω</span></b> , (from <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">λαχάν</span>-<div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>y</i><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ω</span>, cf. <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">λάχανον</span>) <i>dig</i>, 
